*** Variables ***
${SHIP_NAME}              Starlight Explorer
${DIAGNOSTIC_VERSION}     2.7.3

*** Test Cases ***
Complete Ship Diagnostic Data Model
    ${timestamp}         Set Variable    2157-03-15 14:23:47 UTC

    @{damaged_systems}   Create List    Hull Sector 7-Alpha    Navigation Array B    Life Support Module 3    Communication Relay Station    Sensor Grid Beta

    ${first_damage}      Set Variable    ${damaged_systems}[0]
    Log                  First damaged system: ${first_damage}
    ${last_damage}       Set Variable    ${damaged_systems}[-1]
    Log                  Last damaged system: ${last_damage}
    ${third_damage}      Set Variable    ${damaged_systems}[2]
    Log                  Third damaged system: ${third_damage}

    &{system_status}     Create Dictionary    Navigation=DEGRADED    Power=OPERATIONAL    LifeSupport=CRITICAL    Weapons=OFFLINE    Shields=OPERATIONAL

    ${nav_status}        Set Variable    ${system_status}[Navigation]
    Log                  Navigation status: ${nav_status}
    ${ls_status}         Set Variable    ${system_status}[LifeSupport]
    Log                  Life Support status: ${ls_status}

    Log Many             Damaged Components:    @{damaged_systems}
    Log Dictionary       ${system_status}

    Log                  Diagnostic complete for ${SHIP_NAME} at ${timestamp} - ${damaged_systems}[0] requires immediate attention - Navigation: ${system_status}[Navigation]
